# evals/dataset/ — AI-SPEC §5 reference dataset (15 cases, built incrementally)
#
# Each case is a recorded quiz generation, stored as a JSON file shaped:
#   {
#     "id": "string",                 — unique case id
#     "requestedCount": number,       — the question count the owner requested
#     "difficulty": "лёгкий|средний|сложный",
#     "clarifyingPrompt": "string",
#     "source": "string",             — the source material (truncated, as sent to OpenAI)
#     "finish_reason": "stop",        — OpenAI completion finish_reason
#     "output": { ...GeneratedQuiz }  — the quiz JSON the model returned
#   }
#
# The D1-D3 Vitest suite (../quiz-schema.eval.test.ts) replays every *.json here
# against the real QuizSchema. With zero fixtures the suite stays green via an
# it.todo placeholder — populate this directory per AI-SPEC §5 (predominantly
# Russian-source: 5 critical-path, 3 difficulty-spread, 4 edge, 2 adversarial).
#
# This .gitkeep keeps the directory under version control while it is empty.
